Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns and how they will be used  
`id` : station filter – keep only records for `USW00094846`  
`date` : calendar filter – keep only the last 15 days (Dec 17‑31) of every year  
`element` : choose the weather variable (`PRCP`, `TMAX`, `TMIN`)  
`value` : numerical magnitude of the observation (to be rescaled)  
`qflag` : data‑quality control – retain rows where `qflag IS NULL` (validated data)  
`_TABLE_SUFFIX` : comes from BigQuery’s wildcard tables – lets us scan only the yearly tables we need (`2013`‑`2016`)

Typical conditions that will be used  
• `id = 'USW00094846'`  
• `_TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '2013' AND '2016'`  
• `qflag IS NULL`  
• `element IN ('PRCP','TMAX','TMIN')`  
• `EXTRACT(MONTH  FROM date) = 12 AND EXTRACT(DAY FROM date) >= 17`  

Below are ten progressively more complex inspection queries, ending with the final answer query.  
(Every query is limited to 20 rows unless noted otherwise.)

```sql
-- 1. Description: Peek at the three elements that exist for 2013 at the station.
SELECT DISTINCT element
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ghcn_d.ghcnd_2013`
WHERE id = 'USW00094846'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Description: Sample validated precipitation records for the last 15 days of 2013.
SELECT id, date, element, value
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ghcn_d.ghcnd_2013`
WHERE id = 'USW00094846'
  AND element = 'PRCP'
  AND qflag IS NULL
  AND EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date)=12
  AND EXTRACT(DAY FROM date) >= 17
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Description: Sample validated maximum‑temperature records for the last 15 days of 2014.
SELECT id, date, element, value
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ghcn_d.ghcnd_2014`
WHERE id = 'USW00094846'
  AND element = 'TMAX'
  AND qflag IS NULL
  AND EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date)=12
  AND EXTRACT(DAY FROM date) >= 17
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description: Sample validated minimum‑temperature records for the last 15 days of 2015.
SELECT id, date, element, value
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ghcn_d.ghcnd_2015`
WHERE id = 'USW00094846'
  AND element = 'TMIN'
  AND qflag IS NULL
  AND EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date)=12
  AND EXTRACT(DAY FROM date) >= 17
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Description: Retrieve all three variables for one year (2016) so we can see them together.
SELECT id, date, element, value
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ghcn_d.ghcnd_2016`
WHERE id = 'USW00094846'
  AND element IN ('PRCP','TMAX','TMIN')
  AND qflag IS NULL
  AND EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date)=12
  AND EXTRACT(DAY FROM date) >= 17
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Description: Maximum validated precipitation (still in raw tenths‑mm) in the last 15 days of each year.
SELECT
  _TABLE_SUFFIX AS year,
  MAX(value) AS max_prcp_raw
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ghcn_d.ghcnd_*`
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '2013' AND '2016'
  AND id = 'USW00094846'
  AND element = 'PRCP'
  AND qflag IS NULL
  AND EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date)=12
  AND EXTRACT(DAY FROM date) >= 17
GROUP BY year
ORDER BY year
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Description: Maximum validated TMAX (raw tenths‑°C) in the last 15 days of each year.
SELECT
  _TABLE_SUFFIX AS year,
  MAX(value) AS max_tmax_raw
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ghcn_d.ghcnd_*`
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '2013' AND '2016'
  AND id = 'USW00094846'
  AND element = 'TMAX'
  AND qflag IS NULL
  AND EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date)=12
  AND EXTRACT(DAY FROM date) >= 17
GROUP BY year
ORDER BY year
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Description: Minimum validated TMIN (raw tenths‑°C) in the last 15 days of each year.
SELECT
  _TABLE_SUFFIX AS year,
  MIN(value) AS min_tmin_raw
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ghcn_d.ghcnd_*`
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '2013' AND '2016'
  AND id = 'USW00094846'
  AND element = 'TMIN'
  AND qflag IS NULL
  AND EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date)=12
  AND EXTRACT(DAY FROM date) >= 17
GROUP BY year
ORDER BY year
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Description: Combine all three metrics (still raw scale) for the four‑year window.
SELECT
  _TABLE_SUFFIX AS year,
  MAX(CASE WHEN element='PRCP' THEN value END) AS max_prcp_raw,
  MAX(CASE WHEN element='TMAX' THEN value END) AS max_tmax_raw,
  MIN(CASE WHEN element='TMIN' THEN value END) AS min_tmin_raw
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ghcn_d.ghcnd_*`
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '2013' AND '2016'
